# Keep the build context tiny. Everything except the Dockerfiles and staged build
# inputs is excluded. build.sh stages corp-root.pem; build-designer.sh stages the
# pencil-design skill under designer-skills/ before `docker build`.
*
!agent-dev-worker.Dockerfile
!agent-designer-worker.Dockerfile
!corp-root.pem
!designer-skills
!designer-skills/**
